OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA bright but rather breezy day
OL,6,Fwith a few sunny spells in the east.
OL,7,FCloudier in the west with scattered
OL,8,Fshowers and a few brighter spells.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FRemaining cloudy with showers
OL,11,Fin the west continuing through the
OL,12,Fevening, a few clearer spells
OL,13,Fdeveloping overnight. Winds easing
OL,14,Fovernight too.
OL,15,
OL,16,CWednesday:FA bright start in the east
OL,17,Fbut damp and cloudy in the west. A
OL,18,Frisk of afternoon showers developing
OL,19,Fwith some of them becoming slow moving
OL,20,Fwith some thunder.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
